        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions CI-LIZARD Cast Iron Tropical Lizard Door Pull</b>\r\n<p>\r\nAmazing Lizard door pull from the new <a href=\"/site/department.cfm?id=214719\">Nature Collection by First Impressions</a>. Made from heavy Cast Iron and finished in your choice of ultra durable Powder Coated colors.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThe Powder Coated finish is very resistant to peeling, fading,  scratching and requires no maintenance to retain its beauty.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nUse this Lizard door pull on cabinets, pantry room doors,  armoires, almost any door. You could just mount it to the wall for decoration with the optional surface mounting kit if desired. Use your imagination and have fun!\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for First Impressions CI-LIZARD  Lizard Door Pull\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 9-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Cast Iron</li>\r\n<li>Available Finishes: 3</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Packaged Standard with Thrubolt mounting (Bolts through the door). Optional Surface mounting or Glass Door mounting kits (for glass door up to 1/2\" thick, includes 2 inside screw covers).\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
